  {
   "id": "resident-evil-2-19686@post-2022-06-16",
   "gameId": "resident-evil-2-19686",
   "displayName": "DirectX 11 Non-Ray Tracing Version Now Available",
   "kind": "hotfix",
   "kindBasis": "inferred",
   "announcedAt": "2022-06-16T03:55:22.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Hello Resident Evil fans,",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Due to overwhelming community response, we've reactivated the previous version that does not include ray tracing and enhanced 3D audio. Both enhanced and previous versions will be made available going forward.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Please follow the steps below if you wish to roll back to the previous version.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "1. Click LIBRARY in Steam client.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "2. Right-click the game and select \"\"Properties...\"\"",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "3. In the pop-up menu, select \"\"BETAS\"\"",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "4. From the pull-down menu, select \"\"dx11_non-rt\"\" (Note: password not required)",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "5. Close the pop-up menu and let the Steam client auto-update the game",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "6. You should be able to launch the game normally once the update completes",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "7. Please note some of the in-game option settings will be reset as a result of the rollback process.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "If you would like to update the game to the new version again, simply select \"\"None\"\" from the pull-down menu in Step 4 above.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Resident Evil Team",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
